{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20262E146Is6r91792104740.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>油價從六個月高位略為回落。</p><p></p><p>紐約期油及倫敦期油於今早亞洲市均回落百分之1，紐約期油回落至102水平，倫敦期油回落至115水平。當中倫敦期油上周升了超過百分之6，今年以來升了約九成。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:27.244238+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":90,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T00:16:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T05:38:01.176430+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:13:58.630500+00:00","content_hash":"7d30e745499257403237eca4a627a0fabf4b548a5b202ae1bf9081ecbebfd828","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:27.244238+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}